tch","merged_at":"2026-07-27T14:53:38Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15233\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nThis PR renames the shortcut path `script_editor/window_move_up` and `down` to `script_editor/move_document_up` and `down`. Also updates the shortcut display names from `Move Up` and `Down` to `Move Document Up` and `Down`.\r\n\r\nIt also removes the default keybind (`Shift+Alt+Up/Down`) for these shortcuts, leaving them unbind by default.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"1492\" height=\"488\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260723-221129_Godot Engine 4\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5f14c53a-3bee-4a02-ad40-d65cca3a41af\" />\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"1303\" height=\"454\" alt=\"markup_1000252638\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9f566de-04c3-4683-a953-894c84abe25f\" />","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/use